              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi ariphomuuza Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba, “Usiambuke mwenga kpwa mwenga ela azunguluke ukaashambuliye kula uphande wa nyuma, hiko mbere za mihi ya miforisadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
