          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi wahenda dza arivyolagizwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, naye achiapiga Afilisti kula Geba hadi Gezeri.",
